{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Bit It</strong> is a local coop puzzle platformer for <strong>2 players</strong> <br>and a wonderful way to spend time with your <strong>beloved</strong> one!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will need to reunite with your <strong>partner</strong> in order to beat this game!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069270/extras/7a89e5752602b738f7cab2916d0eb02b.poster.avif?t=1762234918\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069270/extras/7a89e5752602b738f7cab2916d0eb02b.webm?t=1762234918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069270/extras/7a89e5752602b738f7cab2916d0eb02b.mp4?t=1762234918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You will conquer 3 different worlds - in each of them you will use 3 different abilities to beat every level!<br>And with the time passing you will learn new skills and how to use this abilities in a <strong>new</strong> and<strong>\u00a0exciting\u00a0</strong>way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069270/extras/fac317010a6a78d281a8b86fadaf1f5f.poster.avif?t=1762234918\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4069270/extras/fac317010a6a78d281a8b86fadaf1f5f.webm?t=1762234918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:/